go-pcre2 includes code generated from third-party software.

internal/wasm/pcre2.wasm.go is a translation, by wasm2go, of a WebAssembly
build of:

- PCRE2 (https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2), distributed under
  BSD-3-Clause WITH PCRE2-exception. The full licence is in
  LICENSES/PCRE2-LICENCE.md. The PCRE2 JIT is not included in this build.

- wasi-libc (https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-libc), as shipped in wasi-sdk
  25, for the C library functions PCRE2 uses (malloc, free, memcpy and
  similar). See that project's LICENSE files for its terms.

wasm2go (https://github.com/ncruces/wasm2go) is used at build time only; its
output carries no wasm2go runtime.
